  "answer_text": "Here is an overview of **ProFed Credit Union** (accessible at [profedcu.org](https://www.profedcu.org)):\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe6 About ProFed Credit Union\n\nFounded in 1933, ProFed Credit Union is a **$740 million financial cooperative** with nearly **66,000 member-owners**. It provides financial services to members and businesses all over **Northeast Indiana**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udc65 Membership\n\nYou can own a piece of the credit union with just **$5**. Membership gets you exclusive access to lower fees and competitive rates, plus local, personalized service, discounted perks, and a cooperative that supports your community.\n\nYou are eligible to join if you **live, work, worship, attend school, volunteer, or regularly conduct business** in Adams, Allen, DeKalb, Huntington, LaGrange, Noble, Steuben, Wells, and Whitley counties.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf10 Locations & Access\n\nProFed has **13 branch locations** in northeast Indiana. They meet you where you are \u2014 you can book a time for an **in-person or virtual meeting** in minutes.\n\nSome branch locations include cities like **Fort Wayne, Auburn, Decatur, New Haven, Bluffton, Angola, and Columbia City**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcda Financial Resources\n\nProFed offers a wide range of resources for kids, adults, and businesses \u2014 from budgeting basics to investing and planning for retirement \u2014 and best of all, it's **free** to the community.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcbc Community Involvement\n\nProFed takes pride in its work and involvement in communities, genuinely caring about its employees and sincerely wanting to make a difference for the members they serve.\n\n---\n\nFor more information, visit their official website at **[profedcu.org](https://www.profedcu.org)** or reach out to any of their 13 branch locations across Northeast Indiana.",
